_paragraph--mt-auto-truncate-text-hz-hint">Universitas Demo</p></div></div><dl class="situs-main__definition-list--mt-2"><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Penulis</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($d->penulis) ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Pembimbing</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($d->pembimbing ?: '-') ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Program studi</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($d->prodi) ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Tahun</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($d->tahun) ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Halaman</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($halamanTeks) ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Akses</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e($aksesLabel) ?></dd></div><div class="situs-main__definition-list-box situs-main__definition-list-box--h-9"><dt class="situs-main__definition-list-term--shrink-0">Diterbitkan</dt><dd class="situs-main__definition-list-detail--min-w-0"><?= e(formatTanggal($d->terbit_pada)) ?></dd></div></dl><div aria-hidden="true" class="situs-main__box--mt-2-bg-border-50-h-0-5"></div><?php if ($login): ?><?php if ($adaPdf): ?><div class="situs-main__box--gap-2-flex-mt-15px"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="button button--flex-1-bg-primary-text-primary-foreground-px-5 group/button has-size" href="<?= e($urlBaca) ?>"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="button__icon button__icon--size-4 has-size" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v16"></path><path d="M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z"></path></svg>Baca dokumen</a><?php if ((int) $d->bisa_unduh): ?><a data-slot="popover-trigger" data-variant="outline" data-size="default" class="popover-trigger popover-trigger--flex-1 group/button has-size" href="<?= e($urlUnduh) ?>"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="popover-trigger__icon popover-trigger__icon--size-4 has-size" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15V3"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path></svg><span class="popover-trigger__text--max-lg-sr-only">Unduh PDF</span></a><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?><?php else: ?><div class="situs-main__box--gap-2-flex-mt-15px"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="button button--flex-1-bg-primary-text-primary-foreground-px-5 group/button has-size" href="<?= BASE_URL ?>masuk.php"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="button__icon button__icon--size-4 has-size" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 17 5-5-5-5"></path><path d="M15 12H3"></path><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"></path></svg>Masuk untuk membaca</a></div><?php endi